{
  "_about": "SONIC vocabulary: how words in a sound's name, title and search query become semantic tags, and how an engine event (a clash, a whoosh, a landing...) becomes a request to the catalog. Nothing here is specific to Paper Cinema: another project can ship its own vocab file (tools/sonic.mjs --vocab <file>). Edit this file to teach Sonic new words; run `node tools/sonic.mjs scan` and every sound is re-tagged (the audio is not re-analysed). Guide: docs/SONIC.md.",
